る舞いは身に付いたが、友人の作り方や遊び方は学べず同年代との距離感があまりつかめていない模様。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"男女の恋愛を演劇や小説でしか知らず、出会いはドラマティックなものと信じている少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"何でも完璧にこなせるが、家事能力だけは皆無なため、メイドのパティに身の回りの世話をしてもらっている。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"200039"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/88/88a8a451a9faf4033b2cf93ba1ae707964be31d1c9b807fa213ede65b880ded4.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a6/a6c8e4ffd846d52753b5492e46af34117a17829a7022f9a437831620c762a906.webp","width":194,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"湯宮由海","creatorId":"vndb:s5006","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s5006","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s5006","name":"湯宮 由海","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:622934:200039:19558:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c163311","characterName":"星 詠美","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"200040","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"622934"}],"egsCharacterIds":["28386"],"vndbCharacterId":"c163311"},"originalCharacterName":"星 詠美","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A childhood friend who is constantly putting on a cutesy act. This clever and cute girl is loved by everyone, but her guard drops around you. She cries and gets mad easily, but when you pamper her, she flashes the most wonderful, radiant smile."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From NookGaming"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c163311"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"「あざとい！　かわいい！　アタシを褒めて！」"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ぶりっ子全開の腐れ縁系幼なじみ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公はひょんなことから喧嘩別れしていたはずが、偶然再会して大パニックに！"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"それも今や落ち着いて、ふたりだけの服飾部でぼちぼち会話をする仲になったのだが……ぶりっ子はあいかわらずなのだった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"あざとくてカワイイ彼女は、みんなから愛されている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の前ではガードが緩みがち。すぐ泣く。すぐ怒る。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"でも、甘やかしてあげると最高にかわいい笑顔で笑ってくれる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そんな彼女に振り回されるのも、なんだか悪くないと思ってしまうのだ。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"28386","sourceWorkId":"40138","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"「あざとい！　かわいい！　アタシを褒めて！」"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ぶりっ子全開の腐れ縁系幼なじみ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公はひょんなことから喧嘩別れしていたはずが、偶然再会して大パニックに！"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"それも今や落ち着いて、ふたりだけの服飾部でぼちぼち会話をする仲になったのだが……ぶりっ子はあいかわらずなのだった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"あざとくてカワイイ彼女は、みんなから愛されている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の前ではガードが緩みがち。すぐ泣く。すぐ怒る。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"でも、甘やかしてあげると最高にかわいい笑顔で笑ってくれる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そんな彼女に振り回されるのも、なんだか悪くないと思ってしまうのだ。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"200040"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e3/e3bf3e4474969f9e86f83302b670ea4c75907b74ae692930e21fda00d5eceeba.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b3/b3d6487493d45709687cac2f304693f2b699d43fe5b639f7b16a06540a08d5a8.webp","width":194,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"谷口夢奈","creatorId":"vndb:s14335","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s14335","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s14335","name":"谷口夢奈","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:622934:200040:29570:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c163312","characterName":"千々石 野々","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"200041","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"622934"}],"egsCharacterIds":["28387"],"vndbCharacterId":"c163312"},"originalCharacterName":"千々石 野々","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The poster girl for a local diner. She's used to looking after her siblings, so she often unleashes her \"big sister\" power outside her home. Faced with her caring demeanor, some can't help but feel a primal urge to be babied by her..."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From NookGaming"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c163312"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"行きつけの定食屋の看板娘。いつも笑顔を絶やすことなく、小さな体で元気に店を手伝っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"姉弟の面倒をよく見ているため、家の外でも姉パワーを発揮することが多い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その面倒見のよさは、姉を飛び越えて母へと至る。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"常に周囲を気にかけてくれる彼女に対し、いわゆる『バブみ』を感じずにはいられないとか……。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"今日も食堂を訪れる主人公や妹のうるはを、笑顔で明るく迎えてくれる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"28387","sourceWorkId":"40138","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"行きつけの定食屋の看板娘。いつも笑顔を絶やすことなく、小さな体で元気に店を手伝っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"姉弟の面倒をよく見ているため、家の外でも姉パワーを発揮することが多い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その面倒見のよさは、姉を飛び越えて母へと至る。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"常に周囲を気にかけてくれる彼女に対し、いわゆる『バブみ』を感じずにはいられないとか……。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"今日も食堂を訪れる主人公や妹のうるはを、笑顔で明るく迎えてくれる。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"200041"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/5f/5f1c241df233055d381660b4b4de9a9444197171ae883887a909542faa8ddc41.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/38/3815aeaa3515a95927a72ad0dd8091b9c4096f1603ae52432d2266bac61e2dfa.webp","width":194,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"三浦千幸","creatorId":"vndb:s43655","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s43655","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s43655","name":"三浦 千幸","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:622934:200041:39802:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c163313","characterName":"パティ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"200042","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"622934"}],"egsCharacterIds":["28388"],"vndbCharacterId":"c163313"},"originalCharacterName":"パティ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A maid from Northern Europe who serves the Ootorimine family. She has a calm and composed personality, always maintaining a professional distance as a servant and walking one step behind Nazca. After taking care of chores for the domestically-challenged Nazca, she returns to the Ootorimine mansion, from which she commutes to school."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From NookGaming"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c163313"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"大鳳峰家に仕えるメイドで北欧出身。通称パティ"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"元々日本系の企業で働いていた一家全員が仕えており、日本語が話せるため総帥であるナスカの祖父の指示によりナスカの専属お世話係として働いている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"冷静な性格で落ち着いていて、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"使用人としての距離感を保っておりナスカの一歩後ろを歩く。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"家事が壊滅的なナスカに代わり身の回りの世話をこなした後は大鳳峰の屋敷に戻り、そこから通学している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"恋愛の経験はなく、同じく未経験のナスカに相談されたときは漫画やアニメの知識を吹き込んで２人で実践と検証を行っている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"28388","sourceWorkId":"40138","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"大鳳峰家に仕えるメイドで北欧出身。通常パティ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"元々日本系の企業で働いていた一家全員が仕えており、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"日本語が話せるため総帥であるナスカの祖父の指示によりナスカの専属お世話係として働いている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"冷静な性格で落ち着いていて、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"使用人としての距離感を保っておりナスカの一歩後ろを歩く。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"家事が壊滅的なナスカに代わり身の回りの世話をこなした後は大鳳峰の屋敷に戻り、そこから通学している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"恋愛の経験はなく、同じく未経験のナスカに相談されたときは漫画やアニメの知識を吹き込んで２人で実践と検証を行っている。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"200042"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0f/0f0945b89443f50f2cf694e4c4845225b682a1695a023fe1240ea2ac05829ffd.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8e/8ef78ef58f8c29655c6c0305d4314720b103bebdb2540acf1ed9693329689c47.webp","width":194,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"桐村まり","creatorId":"vndb:s1549","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1549","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1549","name":"柏木逢花","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:622934:200042:23768:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c163314","characterName":"沖田 和歌","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"200044","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"622934"}],"egsCharacterIds":["28389"],"vndbCharacterId":"c163314"},"originalCharacterName":"沖田 和歌","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"An incredibly lazy homeroom teacher. She's a \"disappointing beauty,\" someone who is actually very capable but chooses not to try. Surprisingly, when students truly need her, she'll go the extra mile. She's rumored to be quite beautiful, but her complete lack of feminine charm in her daily behavior leaves everyone second-guessing."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From NookGaming"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c163314"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"超絶めんどくさがりのクラス担任。本当は色々できるのにやろうとしない残念美人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"一方で、教師として頼られるとなんだかんだで面倒を見てくれる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"実は美人ともっぱらの噂だが、普段はあまりに色気が無いふるまいをしているのでみんな半信半疑。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"本人も自分の色気に自覚はないようで、たまにうっかり男子生徒の性癖を壊してしまっているとかいないとか。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"28389","sourceWorkId":"40138","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"超絶めんどくさがりのクラス担任。本当は色々できるのにやろうとしない残念美人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"一方で、教師として頼られるとなんだかんだで面倒を見てくれる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"実は美人ともっぱらの噂だが、普段はあまりに色気が無いふるまいをしているのでみんな半信半疑。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"本人も自分の色気に自覚はないようで、たまにうっかり男子生徒の性癖を壊してしまっているとかいないとか。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"200044"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/2e/2ebe16d6c45912f673ab762c818aa4721636fe94d5916998a7b3b19a511c7201.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/29/29302d2186308a706dc65acdb90a2a74ada1fe0816c44e6fa4ca4e926c19c643.webp","width":194,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"岡本理絵","creatorId":"vndb:s874","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s874","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s874","name":"岡本 理絵","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:622934:200044:13368:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c163315","characterName":"三角 うるは","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"200045","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"622934"}],"egsCharacterIds":["28390"],"vndbCharacterId":"c163315"},"originalCharacterName":"三角 うるは","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Madoka's non-blood-related sister who calls him \"Ani\". A friendly and sociable gyaru. As a central figure in her class, she has a bright personality and gets along with everyone. The consensus among the guys in her class is that she'd be fun to date, but exhausting at the same time. A bit of an airhead, her mind works in mysterious ways."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From NookGaming"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c163315"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"人懐っこい系のギャル。クラスの中心なキャラで、誰とでも仲良く明るく接する。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"クラスの男子からの評価は、『付き合ったら楽しいだろうけど、同時に疲れそう』で満場一致。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"バカだが変に頭が回る（ときがある）ので、良かれと思った行動が、微妙に事態を悪化させたりもする。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"……が、取り返しのつかないレベルにまでならないのは、彼女の人柄か、天運か。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"28390","sourceWorkId":"40138","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"人懐っこい系のギャル。クラスの中心なキャラで、誰とでも仲良く明るく接する。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"クラスの男子からの評価は、『付き合ったら楽しいだろうけど、同時に疲れそう』で満場一致。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"バカだが変に頭が回る（ときがある）ので、良かれと思った行動が、微妙に事態を悪化させたりもする。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"……が、取り返しのつかないレベルにまでならないのは、彼女の人柄か、天運か。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"200045"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e6/e6d86180c391b1054650e66829a3ce5682233289f5441b394c94975f63a3a209.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a5/a52f4292b8f06b25294be471f7a9f84a3daab2cc46283d09b0cfb79d4809c1ad.webp","width":194,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"天季ひより","creatorId":"vndb:s37819","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s37819","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s37819","name":"天季 ひより","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:622934:200045:65194:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c164180","characterName":"三角 円","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c164180"},"originalCharacterName":"三角 円","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c173517","characterName":"大鳳峰家当主","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c173517"},"originalCharacterName":"大鳳峰家当主","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identitySt